Display contract:
  After every real-frame transaction the persistent UI is recreated first. The
  M14 update redraws only the result card and synchronizes that rectangle. A
  no-candidate result is rendered as "INFERENCE COMPLETE / NO VALID CANDIDATE
  / RESULT AWAITS VALIDATION", not as a business PASS. While a touch press is
  active the setter returns busy, preserving the frozen backup-and-restore
  touch feedback behavior.
